      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok for now. The only real use of non-octet-length bit strings is the KeyUsage extension in a certificate. It might be worth having AddASN1BitString(data []byte) and AddASN1BitStringFlags(data []byte) where the former writes a string of len(data)*8 and the latter copies asn1BitLength from x509.go.",
