      "writtenOn": "2017-03-01T00:08:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m wondering how useful this is in general. Certainly if people are going to be storing values from ASN.1 into various sizes of integer, it\u0027s good to centralise overflow checking. But is that a sufficiently common use?\n\n(Fine to include this for now and see how useful it is in practice.)",
